    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy isn't going to stop my brain from dying. it's just gonna be someone watching me lose my mind in slow motion. i just feel like there should be a way to have some dignity in this. like, if i could just choose to go while i'm still \"me\", instead of being a burden to everyone because i forgot how to live. wouldn't it be more merciful to just end it on my own terms?",
